{{also|Maandag|måndag}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|manendach}}, {{m|dum|maendach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*mānendag}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*mānini dag||day of the moon}}.

Compare {{cog|nds|Maandag}}, {{cog|fy|moandei}}, {{cog|de|Montag}}, {{cog|en|Monday}}, {{cog|da|mandag}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/ˈmaːn.dɑx/}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-maandag.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|-:en|+}}

# [[Monday]]
#: {{uxi|nl|Op '''maandag''' begin ik altijd vroeg met werken.|I always start working early on '''Monday'''.}}
#: {{uxi|nl|De '''maandagen''' zijn het drukst in de sportschool.|The '''Mondays''' are the busiest at the gym.}}
#: {{uxi|nl|Ik heb een leuk '''maandagje''' gehad.|I had a nice '''Monday'''.}}

